      <p class="adt-body text-left leading-relaxed text-gray-800">
        <span data-id="pg031_n0006">M&#xeb;simi n&#xeb; distanc&#xeb; shkaktoi disa probleme, t&#xeb; cilave nuk mund t&apos;u gjenim zgjidhje.</span>
        <span data-id="pg031_n0007">P&#xeb;r shembull, shoku yn&#xeb; i klas&#xeb;s nuk kishte telefon p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; komunikuar.</span>
        <span data-id="pg031_n0008">&#xc7;do gj&#xeb; n&#xeb; k&#xeb;t&#xeb; koh&#xeb; ishte e lidhur me teknologjin&#xeb;.</span>
        <span data-id="pg031_n0009">U kujtova q&#xeb; gjyshes sime i kishin dhuruar nj&#xeb; telefon.</span>
        <span data-id="pg031_n0010">Mendova se Besmirit n&#xeb; k&#xeb;to momente do t&#x2019;i sh&#xeb;rbente m&#xeb; shum&#xeb;</span>
